              "name": "Model body",
              "fill": "#3A342C",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "One project, told as process documentation. The flight is the spine. Visual work is grouped by what it does in the system, not by the order it was made. Ableton is the cue sheet a person plays live. TouchDesigner sends those clips to the room. There is no audio reactivity. Sketches and dropped directions stay in the story.",
